{
    "title": "Lacquergram: for Nail Polish L",
    "description": "Join our nail polish addicted community and organize your own collection:\r\n- Make your inventory and wishlists of nail polishes.\r\n- Move unwanted polishes to destash.\r\n- Discover new nail polish collections and be inspired.\r\n- Share your honest opinions about nail lacquers.\r\n- Upload your swatches to help other users to choose.\r\n- Connect with people who share your passion for nails.\r\n\r\nYou will always know which nail polishes you already have and which you want to buy. Lacquergram covers a lot of your favourite brands and new nail polish releases. If not, you can suggest your nail polish and we will add it as soon as possible. Look for new shades for this Christmas? Just type \"holiday 2018\" and enjoy. Or maybe you need \"wine shimmer\" shade for winter? Here you are! Use the app for access to thousands nail polish swatches and reviews from your phone and connect with nail polish lovers worldwide. \r\n\r\nWe're always working to improve the app and appreciate any feedback. If you have questions or suggestions please feel free to contact us via email lacquergram.app@gmail.com.\r\n\r\nLacquergram is the perfect app for all nail polish lovers!\r\n\r\nOur nail polish database contains thousands of nail polishes from drugstore finds to professional products, from indie polishes and luxe brands: OPI, Essie, China Glaze, Zoya, Orly, CND, Alessandro, Sallu Hansen, A-England, Cirque Colors, ILNP, Picture Polish, Masura, Dance Legend, Deborah Lippmann, Dior, Chanel, YSL, Mavala, KL Polish, Pupa, H&M, Golden Rose etc. You can find nail polishes of all the colours and different textures: cream, shimmer, glitter, holo, mica, flakies, jelly, metallic, nude, white, pink, red, purple, blue, green, teal, mint, yellow, orange, brown, black, grey. Use them alone or mix in nail art!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Join our nail polish addicted community and organize your own collection:<br>- Make your inventory and wishlists of nail polishes.<br>- Move unwanted polishes to destash.<br>- Discover new nail polish collections and be inspired.<br>- Share your honest opinions about nail lacquers.<br>- Upload your swatches to help other users to choose.<br>- Connect with people who share your passion for nails.<br><br>You will always know which nail polishes you already have and which you want to buy. Lacquergram covers a lot of your favourite brands and new nail polish releases. If not, you can suggest your nail polish and we will add it as soon as possible. Look for new shades for this Christmas? Just type &quot;holiday 2018&quot; and enjoy. Or maybe you need &quot;wine shimmer&quot; shade for winter? Here you are! Use the app for access to thousands nail polish swatches and reviews from your phone and connect with nail polish lovers worldwide. <br><br>We&#39;re always working to improve the app and appreciate any feedback. If you have questions or suggestions please feel free to contact us via email lacquergram.app@gmail.com.<br><br>Lacquergram is the perfect app for all nail polish lovers!<br><br>Our nail polish database contains thousands of nail polishes from drugstore finds to professional products, from indie polishes and luxe brands: OPI, Essie, China Glaze, Zoya, Orly, CND, Alessandro, Sallu Hansen, A-England, Cirque Colors, ILNP, Picture Polish, Masura, Dance Legend, Deborah Lippmann, Dior, Chanel, YSL, Mavala, KL Polish, Pupa, H&amp;M, Golden Rose etc. You can find nail polishes of all the colours and different textures: cream, shimmer, glitter, holo, mica, flakies, jelly, metallic, nude, white, pink, red, purple, blue, green, teal, mint, yellow, orange, brown, black, grey. Use them alone or mix in nail art!",
